  "releaseNotes": "New: NovaBorderlessWindowStyle (in NovaWindowStyle.xaml, merged by CannoliBorderlessWindowStyle.xaml) is the Nova main window: window icon (Window.Icon or the icon of the exe), regular weight title, minimize, maximize/restore and close buttons. Apps opt in with AlternateStyle=\"NovaBorderlessWindowStyle\". The existing window styles are the original ones. AssemblyVersion is unchanged. Targets .NET Framework 4.8 (lib\\net48).",
